WEBVTT

00:00:12.723 --> 00:00:14.203
-Kitty.
-Boo.

00:00:20.963 --> 00:00:24.403
RANDALL: Look at everybody's
favorite scarer now.

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:27.523
You stupid, pathetic waste.

00:00:30.603 --> 00:00:34.843
You've been number one for too long,
Sullivan. Now your time is up.

00:00:35.643 --> 00:00:40.083
And don't worry.
I'll take good care of the kid.

00:00:40.403 --> 00:00:41.483
No!

00:00:41.563 --> 00:00:42.923
(YELLING)

00:01:00.803 --> 00:01:02.683
(ROARING ANGRILY)

00:01:03.243 --> 00:01:04.843
She's not scared of you anymore.

00:01:06.883 --> 00:01:09.203
Looks like you're out of a job.

00:01:10.283 --> 00:01:13.203
OK, over the plate.
Let's see the old stuff.

00:01:13.283 --> 00:01:15.163
Chuck him, baby.

00:01:15.243 --> 00:01:18.443
Here's the pitch and he is out of here.

00:01:19.923 --> 00:01:21.963
BOY: Mama, another gator
got in the house.

00:01:22.003 --> 00:01:23.363
MOTHER: Another gator?

00:01:23.443 --> 00:01:25.523
Give me that shovel. There!

00:01:26.123 --> 00:01:27.643
Get him, Mama. Get that gator.

00:01:27.763 --> 00:01:28.803
(RANDALL SCREAMING)

00:01:30.203 --> 00:01:33.283
-Care to do the honors, Mikey?
-With pleasure.

00:01:42.883 --> 00:01:44.963
That's right, Boo. You did it.

00:01:45.003 --> 00:01:46.643
You beat him.

00:01:46.843 --> 00:01:48.243
Come on.

00:01:51.283 --> 00:01:52.763
OK, Boo, it's time to go home.

00:01:52.803 --> 00:01:55.763
Take care of yourself
and be a good girl, OK?

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:57.483
(GASPS)

00:01:57.563 --> 00:01:59.803
-Oh, no.
-The power's out. Make her laugh.

00:01:59.843 --> 00:02:02.963
I got a move here
that'll bring down the house.

00:02:06.803 --> 00:02:09.083
-Sorry. She didn't see that.
-What?

00:02:09.163 --> 00:02:12.283
What, did you forget to check
if her hood was up, you big dope?

00:02:12.323 --> 00:02:15.323
Uncle Mike, try not to yell
in front of her.

00:02:15.443 --> 00:02:18.163
-You know we need her to laugh.
-Right.

00:02:18.443 --> 00:02:20.723
Hey, Boo. Just kidding. Look.

00:02:21.243 --> 00:02:23.283
Funny, right? See, with the...

00:02:23.323 --> 00:02:26.843
These are the jokes, kid.
What's happening?

00:02:27.683 --> 00:02:28.803
Hold on.

00:02:29.683 --> 00:02:32.403
When the door lands in the station,
cut the power.

00:02:32.483 --> 00:02:36.843
You'll have the child and the criminals
responsible for this whole mess.

00:02:38.363 --> 00:02:41.363
Great. A welcoming committee.
What are we gonna do?

00:02:53.883 --> 00:02:58.363
CDA AGENT 1: This is the CDA. Come
out slowly with the child in plain sight.

00:02:58.443 --> 00:03:01.083
OK, OK, you got us.

00:03:01.363 --> 00:03:02.883
Here we are. Here's the kid.

00:03:03.083 --> 00:03:07.363
I'll cooperate, but before you
take us away, I have one thing to say.

00:03:08.563 --> 00:03:10.643
-Catch.
-CDA AGENT 1: 2319.

00:03:11.203 --> 00:03:13.283
We have a toxic projectile.

00:03:13.963 --> 00:03:17.203
-CDA AGENT 2: After the suspect.
-Stop him!

00:03:20.443 --> 00:03:22.883
-Come on.
-Don't let them get away.

00:03:25.283 --> 00:03:27.843
Wait. Come back.
He has the child.

00:03:33.443 --> 00:03:35.323
Sullivan. Sullivan!

00:03:35.683 --> 00:03:39.403
Give me the child. Give her to me!

00:03:48.403 --> 00:03:51.123
WATERNOOSE: Open this door.
Open this door!

00:03:57.083 --> 00:03:58.323
Stop it.

00:03:58.563 --> 00:04:00.003
Don't do it.

00:04:01.483 --> 00:04:03.763
-Come on.
-WATERNOOSE: Don't go in that room.

00:04:07.763 --> 00:04:10.683
I think we stopped him, Boo.
You're safe now.

00:04:10.763 --> 00:04:12.643
You be a good girl, OK?

00:04:13.963 --> 00:04:17.603
-This has gone far enough, James.
-She's home. Leave her alone.

00:04:17.683 --> 00:04:20.283
I can't do that.
She's seen too much.

00:04:20.403 --> 00:04:23.083
-You both have.
-It doesn't have to be this way.

00:04:23.123 --> 00:04:25.923
I have no choice. Times have changed.

00:04:25.963 --> 00:04:29.043
-Scaring isn't enough anymore.
-But kidnapping?

00:04:29.123 --> 00:04:32.163
I'll kidnap 1,000 children
before I let the company die.

00:04:32.523 --> 00:04:35.363
And I'll silence anyone
who gets in my way!

00:04:37.203 --> 00:04:38.643
No!

00:04:38.723 --> 00:04:40.243
ANIMATRONIC BOY: Night, Mom.
MOTHER: Night, sweetheart.

00:04:40.323 --> 00:04:41.803
-ANIMATRONIC BOY: Night, Mom.
-What is this?

00:04:41.883 --> 00:04:43.643
COMPUTER VOICE:
Simulation terminated.

00:04:43.723 --> 00:04:45.523
Simulation terminated.

00:04:46.003 --> 00:04:48.683
Well, I don't know
about the rest of you guys,

00:04:48.763 --> 00:04:51.163
but I spotted several big mistakes.

00:04:51.283 --> 00:04:53.243
But how did...

00:04:53.323 --> 00:04:56.723
You know what? Let's watch
my favorite part again. Shall we?

00:04:56.803 --> 00:04:59.923
I'll kidnap 1,000 children
before I let this company die.

00:05:00.523 --> 00:05:04.043
I'll kidnap 1,000 children
before I let this company die.

00:05:04.163 --> 00:05:08.003
I'll kidnap 1,000 children
before I let this company die.

00:05:08.683 --> 00:05:09.843
-CDA AGENT: Come with us.
-What are you doing?

00:05:09.923 --> 00:05:12.203
Take your hands off.
You can't arrest me.

00:05:12.283 --> 00:05:15.843
I hope you're happy, Sullivan.
You destroyed this company.

00:05:15.883 --> 00:05:20.163
Monsters, Incorporated is dead!
Where will everyone get their scream?

00:05:20.443 --> 00:05:24.523
The energy crisis will only get worse
because of you!

00:05:29.403 --> 00:05:31.963
Stay where you are.
Number one wants to talk to you.

00:05:32.203 --> 00:05:33.603
Attention.

00:05:40.603 --> 00:05:42.203
Hello, boys.

00:05:42.363 --> 00:05:43.403
-Roz?
-Roz?

00:05:44.923 --> 00:05:49.363
Two and a half years of
undercover work were almost wasted

00:05:49.683 --> 00:05:52.643
when you intercepted that child,
Mr. Sullivan.

00:05:53.483 --> 00:05:55.363
Of course, without your help,

00:05:55.403 --> 00:05:59.483
I never would have known that
this went all the way up to Waternoose.

00:06:03.603 --> 00:06:06.003
Now, about the girl.

00:06:06.723 --> 00:06:08.963
I just want to send her home.

00:06:09.843 --> 00:06:11.243
Very good.

00:06:11.923 --> 00:06:14.883
-Bring me a door shredder.
-What? You mean...

00:06:14.883 --> 00:06:16.403
You mean I can't see her again?

00:06:17.603 --> 00:06:19.843
That's the way it has to be.

00:06:21.323 --> 00:06:23.123
I'll give you five minutes.

00:06:34.883 --> 00:06:37.403
-Well, so long, kid.
-Mike Wazowski.

00:06:38.083 --> 00:06:39.203
Yeah.

00:06:39.763 --> 00:06:40.923
Boo.

00:06:40.963 --> 00:06:42.363
It's been fun.

00:06:45.123 --> 00:06:47.283
Go ahead. Go grow up.

00:06:59.443 --> 00:07:01.003
(SQUEALING IN DELIGHT)

00:07:07.403 --> 00:07:08.923
But, Boo...

00:07:09.923 --> 00:07:11.043
Boo.

00:07:11.843 --> 00:07:13.963
Look at that. You know...

00:07:15.003 --> 00:07:16.763
That's cute. Yeah.

00:07:16.803 --> 00:07:18.083
(SPEAKING BABY TALK)

00:07:18.123 --> 00:07:19.363
Boo...

00:07:20.883 --> 00:07:22.803
Well, that's very nice.

00:07:24.123 --> 00:07:25.723
Come here, you!

00:07:25.803 --> 00:07:28.323
(BOTH LAUGHING)

00:07:33.683 --> 00:07:36.043
♪ Oh, he's a happy bear ♪

00:07:37.963 --> 00:07:39.643
(BABY TALK)

00:07:42.123 --> 00:07:45.403
Nothing's coming out of your closet
to scare you anymore, right?

00:07:46.163 --> 00:07:47.443
Yeah.

00:07:49.483 --> 00:07:51.003
Goodbye, Boo.

00:07:52.123 --> 00:07:53.283
Kitty.

00:07:54.643 --> 00:07:56.323
Kitty has to go.

